--- task
id: t11
dataset: section8
kind: either orientation

--- intent
List the names of the people linked to the person with handle `$h` by a `knows` edge in either direction.

--- params
{"h": "alice"}

--- edition2
query around($h: String) {
  match { $p: Person { handle: $h }  $p <knows> $f }
  return { $f.name }
}

--- edition3
query around($h: String) {
  match { $p: Person { handle: $h }  $p <knows> $f }
  return { $f.name }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["f.name"]
["Bob"]
["Dave"]
["Carol"]
["Erin"]
